  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will continue cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df8dd3bde5c6d0d04eb1f/step-29b12594.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Zest lemon to get a generous pinch, then slice into wedges. Drain chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add carrot and zucchini and cook, stirring, until slightly softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste, mild curry paste and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add chickpeas and cook, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df8dd3bde5c6d0d04eb1f/step-6e496b29.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in coconut milk, vegetable stock pot, lemon zest, the brown sugar and a generous squeeze of lemon juice. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium. Simmer until veggies are softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach leaves and cook until wilted, 2-3 minutes. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df8dd3bde5c6d0d04eb1f/step-e4da119c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with chickpea and tomato curry.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df8dd3bde5c6d0d04eb1f/step-9ef615e0.jpg"
    }
  ]
